CST Studio Orchestrator MCP
===========================

This project is derived from:

  mcp-cst-studio
  https://github.com/RFingAdam/mcp-cst-studio

The upstream project is licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later. This derivative
keeps the same license.

Notable changes in this derivative include:

- Design Studio schematic MCP tools for RLC blocks, external ports, nets, and schematic inspection.
- Generic `project.schematic` RemoteObject discovery and invocation tools.
- Local validation against CST Studio Suite 2025.2 for schematic block creation, net connection, and generic method calls.
- Project positioning around unified CST Studio Suite orchestration for antennas,
  RF/EM simulation, PCB/SI, schematic design, and field-circuit co-simulation.

CST Studio Suite is a separate commercial product from Dassault Systemes /
SIMULIA. This project does not bundle or redistribute CST Studio Suite.
